    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A canon whose answer interval is chosen by name." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The interesting line is `answer_interval`: a `match` over `Text`, where the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// arm that runs decides what the second voice sings. A text pattern that" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// silently fell through would not fail here — the piece would compile, the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// score would be full, and the canon would be at the unison instead of at the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// fifth. That is the failure this fixture exists to make loud." },
